            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.8+ACT.14.9+ACT.14.10+ACT.14.11+ACT.14.12+ACT.14.13+ACT.14.14+ACT.14.15+ACT.14.16+ACT.14.17+ACT.14.18+ACT.14.19+ACT.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 14:8-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yau ragedo, ku can de; maeni m’anwang’u i Antiokia, ku i Ikonio, ku i Lustra de; thwo ragedo m’aciro: man Rwoth ulara kud i ie ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andha, man dhanu ceke m’uyenyo gibed kud ayi Mungu i Kristu Yesu gibinwang’u ragedo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dhanu ma rac ku ju ma girambri de gibisagri asaga, gibibombo abombi gin de jubibombogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dong’ ibed ku lembe m’igamu ng’eyo con, ku maeni ma cwinyi kwio i kume, m’ing’eyo ko ju m’iponjo ng’eyo lembe i bang’gi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya ugambre ma fodi i mukere ing’eyo lembagora ma leng’ ma copo dwoki riek kum both ma juboth ko ku yioyic ma ni kum Kristu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembagora ceke ma Mungu yuyo i wie ai ba Mungu man ke kulokane nuti mi ponji, mi nyuth ma junyutho ko dubo, ku mi twiny ma jutwinyo kojo de, ku mi ponji ma mi bedopwe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara dhanu pa Mungu copo romo kakare, m’eyikre ndhu kum tic ceke ma ber kubang’gi kubang’gi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
